      "text": "👼 A day in Emily’s life!\n\nA sunny morning today, clouds that form a mess but create their own beauty in aesthetics. Under this bright and beautiful blue sky, but expecting rain to wet the earth tomorrow. &lt;💌&gt; Today Emily has a schedule to go to campus to attend lectures held in the morning. With a beautiful smile like an angel, Emily began to smile to welcome the morning. Emily started preparing what she would bring. Then she continued her duties on the journey, while still smiling so that she was always in a good mood 💞\n\n\n{📎📚} List of Emily's courses\n\n✧˖° Design Basics\n\n✧˖° Illustration\n\n✧˖° Graphic design\n\n✧˖° Photography\n\n✧˖° Interactive Design\n\n✧˖° Product Design",
